WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.470
<b>March Household Expenses</b>

00:00.000 --> 00:00.890
<b>Date</b>

00:00.000 --> 00:00.890
<b>Food</b>

00:00.000 --> 00:00.890
<b>Necessities</b>

00:00.000 --> 00:00.890
<b>Education</b>

00:00.000 --> 00:00.890
<b>Special</b>

00:00.000 --> 00:00.890
<b>Expenditures</b>

00:00.000 --> 00:00.890
<b>Remaining</b>

00:02.350 --> 00:04.600
<b>Total</b>

00:07.660 --> 00:09.730
We're going broke.

00:10.060 --> 00:15.590
I busted our bank account buying that 
stuff for daycare and her room.

00:15.170 --> 00:18.410
Go! Go!

00:16.100 --> 00:17.500
Why are we going broke?

00:17.500 --> 00:19.310
Because we're not working!

00:20.750 --> 00:23.170
We'll have to cut back on our spending.

00:23.430 --> 00:24.830
Why not buy cheaper beer?

00:24.830 --> 00:26.580
<b>Domugi</b>

00:24.830 --> 00:26.580
I already am!

00:27.250 --> 00:29.960
You won't be able to buy 
new games at this rate.

00:31.260 --> 00:33.230
Yahoo!

00:32.120 --> 00:34.050
No pudding for dessert, either.

00:35.220 --> 00:37.590
That's how bleak this all is, people!

00:37.590 --> 00:40.150
We'll be ruined at this rate!

00:42.540 --> 00:44.760
Desperate times call for desperate measures.

00:45.200 --> 00:48.460
Time to pull out the last resort.

00:49.140 --> 00:50.950
And so, Kyu-chan...

00:51.590 --> 00:54.230
I'm begging you! Send some work our way!

00:54.230 --> 00:55.280
We'll do anything!

00:56.320 --> 00:57.940
You get in on this!

00:57.310 --> 00:58.410
Ow, ow, ow...

00:58.690 --> 01:01.550
So you're ready to get back in the game?

01:03.110 --> 01:05.370
Target background checks

01:05.370 --> 01:07.540
and location scouting jobs.

01:08.030 --> 01:11.620
You should start with small jobs to 
get back in the swing of things.

01:12.300 --> 01:13.690
All this?

01:13.690 --> 01:15.600
Great. We'll take everything!

01:15.600 --> 01:19.110
Gotta make up for all that time off! Right?

01:20.560 --> 01:22.240
You have one week.

01:22.240 --> 01:23.990
Leave it to us, Kyu-chan!

01:24.870 --> 01:27.490
C'mon, we're doing this!

01:31.360 --> 01:34.900
<i>Hey, I want to love, is this true love?</i>

01:34.900 --> 01:38.530
<i>Is just wanting to be loved insincere?</i>

01:38.530 --> 01:40.780
<i>What should I do?</i>

01:40.780 --> 01:43.160
<i>Oh, what should I do?</i>

01:46.460 --> 01:49.460
<i>As usual, the whole city</i>

01:49.460 --> 01:53.130
<i>Is madly in love and excited</i>

01:53.130 --> 01:56.670
<i>Extras like me just go home</i>

01:56.670 --> 01:59.970
<i>But I'm not sulking at all</i>

01:59.970 --> 02:03.810
<i>"And then you appeared suddenly</i>

02:03.810 --> 02:07.350
<i>As though you were ripping 
through those days</i>

02:07.350 --> 02:10.940
<i>With your smile that leaves me numb</i>

02:10.940 --> 02:15.280
<i>You shattered my heart</i>

02:16.440 --> 02:20.030
<i>Hey, I want to love, is this true love?</i>

02:20.030 --> 02:23.660
<i>Is just wanting to be loved insincere?</i>

02:23.660 --> 02:25.830
<i>What should I do?</i>

02:25.830 --> 02:28.160
<i>Oh, what should I do?</i>

02:28.460 --> 02:30.540
<i>How the heck should I know?</i>

02:30.540 --> 02:34.380
<i>I don't know what's going on in your head</i>

02:34.380 --> 02:38.050
<i>But it's not fair that you're so friendly</i>

02:38.050 --> 02:42.760
<i>Once again, I'm being 
swallowed up by your rhythm</i>

02:44.930 --> 02:49.600
<i>There you go, you've got me 
wrapped around your finger again</i>

02:55.900 --> 03:00.780
<i>There you go, you've got me 
wrapped around your finger again</i>

03:03.110 --> 03:06.110
Okay, I'll handle this background check.

03:06.110 --> 03:08.330
You do the scouting for this one.

03:08.600 --> 03:10.830
Isn't this stuff <i>your</i> job?

03:10.830 --> 03:13.330
Shut up! Beggars can't be choosers!

03:13.330 --> 03:14.700
Let's just get it done and—

03:13.750 --> 03:16.250
<b>Incoming
Aozora Daycare
Miss Anna
Mobile</b>

03:18.030 --> 03:19.620
It's from the daycare.

03:19.620 --> 03:20.670
What could it be?

03:20.670 --> 03:21.710
Who knows?

03:24.120 --> 03:25.250
Hello?

03:25.250 --> 03:29.100
<i>Hello, this is Hanyu from Aozora Daycare.</i>

03:29.100 --> 03:29.970
Yes?

03:30.280 --> 03:35.070
<i>The truth is, Giraffe Class is going to 
have to stay home for the next few days...</i>

03:35.070 --> 03:37.110
What? Wh-What?!

03:37.110 --> 03:38.620
Can I ask what you mean by that?!

03:38.900 --> 03:41.650
<b>Notice</b>

03:38.900 --> 03:41.650
<b>appreciate your understanding regarding daycare operations</b>

03:38.900 --> 03:41.650
<b>the transmission of a virus within the facility</b>

03:38.900 --> 03:41.650
<b>In order to prevent further spread,</b>

03:38.900 --> 03:41.650
<b>temporary closure</b>

03:38.900 --> 03:41.650
<b>your understanding</b>

03:49.970 --> 03:52.830
Miri-chan, your papas are here to get you!

03:52.830 --> 03:54.430
Papa!

04:00.680 --> 04:02.470
What about the jobs?

04:02.780 --> 04:04.110
You're asking me?

04:04.110 --> 04:07.590
One of us has to stay home 
and watch Miri, right?

04:07.590 --> 04:09.230
This is so bad...

04:10.030 --> 04:12.350
Papa, I wanna go to the park!

04:12.350 --> 04:13.320
Not happening.

04:13.320 --> 04:15.350
We've got our jobs to take care of.

04:15.350 --> 04:17.200
Jobs?

04:17.200 --> 04:18.570
What kind of jobs?!

04:19.830 --> 04:20.630
Um...

04:20.630 --> 04:23.190
G-Grown-up stuff! Never you mind!

04:23.190 --> 04:25.160
But it's my homework.

04:25.160 --> 04:25.880
Huh?

04:25.880 --> 04:27.200
Homework!

04:27.200 --> 04:28.190
Homework?

04:28.190 --> 04:33.840
They said that while we're off we 
gotta ask our dads about their jobs.

04:33.840 --> 04:36.800
Then we gotta tell everyone about it!

04:36.800 --> 04:38.810
Our... jobs?

04:38.810 --> 04:40.290
Tell... everyone?

04:40.290 --> 04:41.990
You got jobs at a company?

04:41.990 --> 04:43.100
No.

04:43.100 --> 04:44.550
A store?

04:44.550 --> 04:45.480
No.

04:45.480 --> 04:47.190
But what jobs do you do?

04:47.190 --> 04:48.940
Um...

04:48.940 --> 04:50.310
Scouting time.

04:50.310 --> 04:50.920
Hey!

04:51.660 --> 04:52.830
Papa Rei!

04:52.830 --> 04:54.070
Where are you going?

04:54.070 --> 04:55.570
What are you doing?

04:55.570 --> 04:56.800
Is it your job?!

04:59.170 --> 05:01.570
No!

05:01.570 --> 05:03.650
I wanna go, too!

05:02.770 --> 05:04.020
Let me go.

05:04.020 --> 05:07.850
I wanna see your job!

05:06.740 --> 05:09.240
What are we gonna do?!

05:21.860 --> 05:26.130
This is my second... no, my 
third straight all-nighter.

05:27.320 --> 05:28.660
I'm back.

05:28.660 --> 05:30.440
Welcome back.

05:30.820 --> 05:32.510
Pictures taken.

05:33.290 --> 05:35.280
It's so late already...

05:36.600 --> 05:41.190
But there's no way to work during the 
day while we're taking care of a kid.

05:41.190 --> 05:42.600
So tired.

05:42.600 --> 05:44.540
Hey, no sleeping.

05:44.540 --> 05:46.950
We've still gotta sort out the photos.

05:47.210 --> 05:48.250
Wake up!

05:48.250 --> 05:50.070
Can't.

05:50.070 --> 05:51.300
Damn you!

05:51.590 --> 05:55.010
You handle your gaming 
all-nighters just fine!

05:58.960 --> 06:01.720
There's no way we're making the deadline.

06:02.910 --> 06:07.350
Might as well ask Kyu-chan for advice...

06:10.840 --> 06:13.110
<i>Hello, everyone!</i>

06:13.110 --> 06:16.350
<i>Now let's do the Veggie Dance!</i>

06:23.780 --> 06:25.100
Hey. Rei.

06:25.790 --> 06:27.170
I'm heading out soon.

06:28.930 --> 06:31.730
Sorry, but I need you to watch Miri.

06:31.730 --> 06:33.240
And the house.

06:41.150 --> 06:42.950
Where are you going, Papa?!

06:42.950 --> 06:44.070
I wanna go!

06:44.070 --> 06:45.890
No way. It's for my job.

06:46.210 --> 06:49.280
Papa Rei will play with you.

06:49.280 --> 06:51.540
Bye. Be good, okay?

06:57.040 --> 06:58.970
Papa Rei!

06:59.640 --> 07:02.040
Play with me!

07:03.400 --> 07:05.960
Papa Rei!

07:27.800 --> 07:30.080
<i>I'm gonna see Papa's job!</i>

07:47.350 --> 07:48.870
Shh!

08:03.540 --> 08:05.330
<b>Yadorigi
Coffee • Light Meals</b>

08:16.460 --> 08:19.030
Bye-bye!

08:21.480 --> 08:24.480
<b>Yadorigi
Coffee • Light Meals</b>

08:22.520 --> 08:23.550
Huh?

08:34.970 --> 08:36.190
Huh?

08:54.090 --> 08:55.130
Miri?

09:01.410 --> 09:03.490
What's this about, now?

09:03.490 --> 09:06.100
It's... about the j-jobs.

09:06.100 --> 09:08.110
Proceeding smoothly, I assume?

09:09.240 --> 09:12.450
Um... well, I needed some advice...

09:14.150 --> 09:14.240
<b>Incoming 
Rei
Mobile</b>

09:14.240 --> 09:14.320
<b>Incoming 
Rei
Mobile</b>

09:14.320 --> 09:14.400
<b>Incoming 
Rei
Mobile</b>

09:14.400 --> 09:14.490
<b>Incoming 
Rei
Mobile</b>

09:14.490 --> 09:15.360
<b>Incoming 
Rei
Mobile</b>

09:16.020 --> 09:19.700
What now? Kyu-chan's already 
pretty pissed at me!

09:19.700 --> 09:20.790
<i>Miri...</i>

09:21.510 --> 09:23.040
<i>Is she with you?</i>

09:24.020 --> 09:25.500
Of course not!

09:26.450 --> 09:28.280
Wait... don't tell me...

09:28.280 --> 09:29.060
<i>She's gone.</i>

09:29.060 --> 09:31.430
Are you kidding me?!

09:45.230 --> 09:46.780
How long's she been missing?

09:47.320 --> 09:48.640
Dunno.

09:50.660 --> 09:52.800
Did she leave?

09:52.800 --> 09:54.030
Dunno.

09:58.570 --> 10:00.790
What the hell's wrong with you?

10:00.790 --> 10:02.330
I've gotta go find her!

10:02.930 --> 10:03.900
I'll go too.

10:24.820 --> 10:25.830
Not her.

10:34.100 --> 10:35.260
I'll be back later.

10:53.760 --> 10:56.310
Sorry for bumping into you.

11:10.980 --> 11:13.230
<b>Yadorigi
</b>Coffee • Light Meals

11:14.360 --> 11:15.730
Any luck?

11:15.730 --> 11:16.800
No.

11:16.800 --> 11:17.930
Yeah, same.

11:20.400 --> 11:22.540
I think it's time. We gotta call the cops!

11:22.540 --> 11:24.530
What? <i>Us</i>?!

11:24.530 --> 11:25.920
What choice do we have?!

11:26.370 --> 11:30.390
Someone might've kidnapped 
her to get back at us!

11:30.390 --> 11:34.030
But she's also so cute, some creep
 might've just run off with her...

11:34.920 --> 11:36.230
Damn it!

11:36.230 --> 11:39.500
I'll find whoever took 
her and tear him apart!

11:39.500 --> 11:44.630
Suspension, blindfold, knife, waterboarding, 
gas burner, pliers, fingernails...

11:44.630 --> 11:45.150
Hey.

11:45.150 --> 11:45.800
You found him?!

11:46.160 --> 11:47.510
I'm thirsty.

11:47.910 --> 11:49.240
I'll kill you!

11:53.400 --> 11:54.780
Miri?!

11:54.780 --> 11:55.730
Papa!

11:55.730 --> 11:57.000
She was here?

11:57.000 --> 11:58.430
I've been looking everywhere!

11:58.430 --> 12:00.810
Sorry, Papa!

12:01.110 --> 12:02.380
Good grief.

12:03.430 --> 12:04.660
"Papa"?

12:06.460 --> 12:08.560
Your parents must be worried sick!

12:08.560 --> 12:10.840
But you're safe now, Miri-chan!

12:12.080 --> 12:15.010
Shucks, we were looking 
everywhere for this kid!

12:15.010 --> 12:17.600
Never thought we'd find her here!

12:17.600 --> 12:19.820
You've a lifesaver, Kyu-chan!

12:20.970 --> 12:24.700
I merely gave shelter to a lost child.

12:25.490 --> 12:27.900
Water please, sir!

12:27.900 --> 12:28.800
Yes, ma'am!

12:31.930 --> 12:34.550
Miri, did you talk to that man?

12:34.550 --> 12:36.100
About us?

12:36.560 --> 12:37.530
No...

12:37.530 --> 12:38.310
Great!

12:38.650 --> 12:39.870
Listen, Miri.

12:39.870 --> 12:44.060
Never call us "Papa" in front of that guy!

12:45.430 --> 12:46.820
Got it!

12:46.820 --> 12:48.400
Got what?

12:48.400 --> 12:50.550
Oh, well...

12:50.550 --> 12:54.690
Lately, we've been taking on 
some babysitting jobs...

12:55.300 --> 12:56.740
You two?

12:57.780 --> 13:01.490
B-But then the kid just went missing!

13:01.490 --> 13:03.460
Had us real freaked out!

13:05.440 --> 13:07.310
And what about my jobs?

13:09.150 --> 13:11.240
W-We're on it, of course.

13:11.240 --> 13:13.960
We're splitting it. It's going great!

13:13.960 --> 13:15.340
We'll get it all done just right!

13:16.150 --> 13:18.400
I can't afford to extend the deadline.

13:19.680 --> 13:21.640
You're sure it's going well?

13:24.520 --> 13:28.320
The truth is, we're a little bit behind.

13:28.720 --> 13:30.850
We haven't had time to sleep.

13:30.850 --> 13:32.570
Three days without sleep.

13:36.360 --> 13:39.810
If the child were out of the picture,
 could you finish the jobs?

13:41.350 --> 13:43.000
Out of the picture?

13:43.000 --> 13:44.190
What are you...

13:47.020 --> 13:48.250
I'll look after her.

13:48.480 --> 13:49.630
No, you can't!

13:49.630 --> 13:52.640
Not even you'd be cold-blooded enough to—

13:53.420 --> 13:55.690
Wait, what'd you say?

13:55.690 --> 13:59.310
I'll look after her so that 
you can focus on my jobs.

14:03.490 --> 14:05.800
Thank you for the drink!

14:08.570 --> 14:11.580
<b>Drawing Pad</b>

14:08.570 --> 14:11.580
<b>Pop</b>

14:08.570 --> 14:11.580
<b>Crunchy</b>

14:08.570 --> 14:11.580
<b>Crayons</b>

14:18.600 --> 14:22.130
The rest of the jobs will 
require a day trip.

14:22.130 --> 14:25.970
We can't make it through today 
without Kyu-chan's help.

14:26.280 --> 14:28.340
And if he finds out about Miri?

14:28.910 --> 14:31.220
Fatal consequences.

14:35.450 --> 14:37.010
Let's go now, Papa!

14:38.330 --> 14:39.680
Listen, Miri.

14:39.680 --> 14:43.780
Don't you breathe one word 
to him about your papas!

14:45.220 --> 14:49.790
Okay! I won't call you "papa," Papa!

14:49.790 --> 14:51.880
I've got a few doubts here.

14:51.880 --> 14:53.330
More than a few.

14:54.630 --> 14:56.710
Thanks a lot, Kyu-chan.

14:57.030 --> 14:58.590
Make sure you meet the deadline.

14:58.590 --> 15:00.820
W-We know, okay?

15:00.820 --> 15:03.250
Be a good girl, Miri-chan!

15:03.250 --> 15:04.290
Okay, Pa—

15:07.560 --> 15:10.060
Have a good trip!

15:12.690 --> 15:14.720
Might I ask your name, dear?

15:15.010 --> 15:18.030
I'm Unasaka Miri, and I'm four years old!

15:18.030 --> 15:19.270
Miri-chan?

15:19.270 --> 15:20.030
Yeah!

15:20.440 --> 15:21.590
Would you like something to drink?

15:23.010 --> 15:24.100
Yeah!

15:39.460 --> 15:41.240
It is complete.

15:42.570 --> 15:45.430
For you, my princess.

15:45.430 --> 15:47.610
Thank you for the drink!

15:51.920 --> 15:52.930
What do you think?

15:52.930 --> 15:55.240
It tastes like heaven!

15:55.240 --> 15:56.100
Heaven?

15:56.100 --> 15:57.960
It's so tasty!

15:57.960 --> 15:59.720
Thank you, mister!

16:00.660 --> 16:02.140
You're very welcome.

16:05.150 --> 16:08.930
Kyu-chan's more cold-blooded than he looks.

16:09.200 --> 16:11.410
He's quite a lady killer as well.

16:13.260 --> 16:17.370
I'm gonna marry Kyutaro-san!

16:17.370 --> 16:18.320
Mwah!

16:18.490 --> 16:19.560
A kiss?

16:19.560 --> 16:20.490
A kiss?!

16:20.490 --> 16:26.530
We gotta get this job 
done and come back ASAP!

16:28.270 --> 16:30.620
Hey, hey! Mister!

16:30.620 --> 16:32.210
Call me Kyu-chan.

16:32.210 --> 16:33.540
Kyu-chan?

16:33.540 --> 16:34.770
Kyu-chan!

16:35.080 --> 16:36.040
What is it?

16:36.040 --> 16:37.040
Are you my papas'...

16:37.850 --> 16:41.080
Are you Kazu-kun and Rei-kun's friend?

16:41.080 --> 16:42.110
I am.

16:42.110 --> 16:44.250
Do you know what job they do?

16:44.250 --> 16:45.520
Of course I do.

16:46.870 --> 16:49.560
I wanna know about their job!

16:49.560 --> 16:52.160
They won't tell me anything!

16:54.050 --> 16:57.760
Well, it's understandable 
that they'd want to hide it.

16:58.340 --> 17:02.160
They both have very special jobs.

17:02.160 --> 17:03.760
Special?

17:03.760 --> 17:04.450
Yes.

17:04.450 --> 17:07.700
Tell me! What's their special jobs?!

17:07.700 --> 17:09.720
Kazuki's is...

17:11.780 --> 17:13.710
a stand-up comedian.

17:13.710 --> 17:16.090
Stand-up comedian?

17:16.090 --> 17:18.690
It's a job where you make others laugh.

17:18.690 --> 17:23.850
But he frequently bombs, so he's too 
embarrassed to tell others about it.

17:24.470 --> 17:28.460
He'll be out there on some stage 
right now, bombing his heart out.

17:30.090 --> 17:31.200
And Rei-kun?

17:32.290 --> 17:33.720
He's...

17:34.190 --> 17:36.310
a Middle Eastern oil baron.

17:36.310 --> 17:37.120
Buh?

17:44.000 --> 17:46.810
She's gonna be spilling everything!

17:46.810 --> 17:48.870
There's no way she'll keep quiet!

17:48.870 --> 17:50.500
It's all gonna be way out there!

17:50.500 --> 17:51.770
<i>It's all gonna be way out there!</i>

17:51.770 --> 17:52.880
We'll see.

17:53.260 --> 17:55.550
<i>We shoulda just called it off!</i>

17:55.550 --> 17:56.630
<i>There's no way it was happening!</i>

17:57.010 --> 17:59.570
<i>We're both doomed!</i>

17:59.570 --> 18:00.620
Shut up.

18:01.660 --> 18:03.780
That's a face?

18:03.780 --> 18:07.640
This one's Kazu-kun,

18:07.640 --> 18:09.460
and this one's Rei-kun.

18:09.460 --> 18:11.470
It's my daycare homework!

18:11.470 --> 18:12.370
Drawing my papas'—

18:12.810 --> 18:14.420
I mean...

18:14.420 --> 18:16.830
Drawing their jobs!

18:16.830 --> 18:18.150
You're a talented artist.

18:21.470 --> 18:24.820
Miri-chan, don't you want to go home?

18:24.820 --> 18:26.910
No, I'm okay.

18:27.140 --> 18:31.760
Isn't your family worried about you 
staying with people you don't know?

18:32.650 --> 18:34.630
I'm okay.

18:34.630 --> 18:38.300
Kazu-kun and Rei-kun will 
be with me forever!

18:38.520 --> 18:39.650
Forever?

18:39.650 --> 18:44.130
Yeah. Kazu-kun's food is super delicious.

18:44.130 --> 18:47.920
Rei-kun's super good at video games.

18:47.920 --> 18:51.180
And it's toasty warm when 
we all sleep together!

18:52.200 --> 18:54.430
You like those two?

18:54.760 --> 18:55.770
Yeah!

18:55.770 --> 18:58.080
I love them <i>so</i> much!

19:01.260 --> 19:02.410
I see.

19:06.540 --> 19:08.290
We're back! Sorry it's so late!

19:08.720 --> 19:09.590
Welcome ba—

19:09.590 --> 19:10.590
Where's the kid?

19:13.370 --> 19:15.220
She just fell asleep.

19:16.260 --> 19:17.410
Thank you.

19:19.890 --> 19:24.450
Hey... did she say anything weird?

19:24.450 --> 19:25.430
Weird? How?

19:25.650 --> 19:27.260
Oh, nothing!

19:27.260 --> 19:29.220
Just glad nothing happened!

19:31.150 --> 19:33.100
Let's head home, then.

19:34.040 --> 19:36.430
Papa Rei...

19:46.290 --> 19:47.830
Listen to that kid!

19:47.830 --> 19:49.870
She says the silliest things in her sleep!

19:49.870 --> 19:52.670
Papa Kazuki bombed...

19:57.860 --> 20:00.370
Well, we're gonna take 
her back to her fami—

20:00.370 --> 20:01.270
Enough.

20:02.370 --> 20:04.320
I know everything.

20:11.310 --> 20:13.230
<b>Day</b>

20:11.310 --> 20:13.810
<b>care</b>

20:11.310 --> 20:13.810
<b>Visiting</b>

20:11.310 --> 20:13.810
<b>Day</b>

20:11.310 --> 20:13.810
<b>Parent Presentation</b>

20:11.310 --> 20:13.810
<b>Parent Presentation</b>

20:12.370 --> 20:17.030
Papa Kazuki, thanks for always 
making delicious food!

20:17.030 --> 20:21.310
Papa Rei, let's play games again some time!

20:21.320 --> 20:27.330
<b>Comedian</b>

20:21.320 --> 20:27.330
<b>Oil Baron</b>

20:21.650 --> 20:28.240
I love my comedian Papa Kazuki and 
oil baron Papa Rei very much!

20:29.080 --> 20:30.950
<b>Sounds like high income</b>

20:29.330 --> 20:30.950
<b>I thought they worked together?</b>

20:29.580 --> 20:30.950
<b>Really?</b>

20:29.830 --> 20:30.950
<b>I smell money</b>

20:30.080 --> 20:30.950
<b>I thought they were hosts</b>

20:30.330 --> 20:30.950
<b>I love performers</b>

20:30.580 --> 20:30.950
<b>An oil baron!?</b>

20:31.950 --> 20:37.460
Papas, please take care and 
work hard at your jobs!

20:37.460 --> 20:39.900
Oil baron? Wow!

20:38.730 --> 20:40.870
I bet they're rich!

20:39.670 --> 20:40.920
Papa!

20:43.070 --> 20:45.270
Thanks for the pictures, Miri.

20:45.810 --> 20:46.880
Well done.

20:49.900 --> 20:51.510
Payment for the jobs.

20:53.040 --> 20:55.990
Now we won't have to cut back on spending.

20:55.990 --> 20:58.400
But Kyu-chan, that was a nasty trick...

20:58.400 --> 21:01.100
You knew everything and didn't tell us?

21:01.100 --> 21:04.590
You should know by now that you 
can't hide things from me.

21:04.590 --> 21:08.360
Well... thanks for giving us a break.

21:08.360 --> 21:12.600
I had intended to take action 
if the child's presence

21:12.600 --> 21:14.740
had once again interfered with your work.

21:15.530 --> 21:18.980
I'm sure you're aware that this is grim business,

21:18.980 --> 21:21.450
in which human life is exchanged for money.

21:21.930 --> 21:26.930
The world will not accept you taking 
in a child and playing at family life.

21:27.840 --> 21:31.510
And if you do anything to 
betray the organization...

21:31.960 --> 21:35.820
Rei, you know those awful 
consequences better than anyone.

21:36.840 --> 21:41.400
Not to mention that we're the 
ones who killed her father.

21:43.410 --> 21:44.360
But...

21:45.510 --> 21:47.790
After spending some time with her,

21:48.400 --> 21:51.670
I've begun to understand why you did it.

21:52.170 --> 21:53.360
Kyu-chan...

21:54.160 --> 21:55.640
She's a good kid.

21:55.640 --> 21:59.830
And she might just change you both...

21:59.830 --> 22:02.760
Though I don't know yet if 
it'll be in a good or bad way.

22:02.760 --> 22:05.190
That's not... why we...

22:05.940 --> 22:08.370
We could all die tomorrow.

22:08.920 --> 22:11.590
Others might resent us and seek revenge on us.

22:11.590 --> 22:15.300
There's a chance that we could put 
others in our lives in danger.

22:17.420 --> 22:19.800
Are you prepared to accept that?

22:25.470 --> 22:27.160
Then don't regret it.

22:30.490 --> 22:35.540
<i>The scenery never changes and 
every day is full of surprises</i>

22:35.540 --> 22:40.000
<i>But those are the best parts</i>

22:40.000 --> 22:44.760
<i>Wrapped around your finger 
and going in circles</i>

22:45.010 --> 22:49.640
<i>These days are dizzying yet endearing</i>

22:49.840 --> 22:54.180
<i>On your restless nights, 
I softly whisper a lullaby</i>

22:54.180 --> 22:58.940
<i>And stroke your hair to the 
rhythm of your breathing</i>

22:59.400 --> 23:03.520
<i>I just want these days to 
continue as long as possible</i>

23:03.520 --> 23:08.530
<i>Even if it's just a day</i>

23:09.320 --> 23:14.240
<i>I chased after you as you ran barefoot</i>

23:14.240 --> 23:18.460
<i>Maybe one day, you'll surpass me, ah</i>

23:18.460 --> 23:23.130
<i>I wonder what tomorrow's going to be like</i>

23:23.130 --> 23:28.050
<i>Why don't we walk together?</i>

23:28.050 --> 23:32.800
<i>This will always be our place to come home to</i>

23:33.300 --> 23:37.600
<i>And it'll shine down on our sadness</i>

23:37.600 --> 23:42.270
<i>That's all right, yeah, that's okay</i>

23:42.270 --> 23:47.190
<i>Let's try to share our love together</i>

23:47.190 --> 23:50.610
<i>Let the light always shine upon hope</i>

23:50.610 --> 23:57.120
<i>When the future is unpredictable</i>
